A [[Bag of Jewels]] is a [[container]] that drops a combination of five random [[crest]]s and/or [[gemstone]]s and a few copper coins. It is used in the [[Mystic Forge]] to craft the [[Goblet of Kings]]. The first six variants are soul-bound-on-acquire, while the remaining two are account-bound

== Acquisition ==
=== Gathered from ===
* [[Fractals of the Mists]], rare drop from boss chests.
* [[Zone|Open world]], very rare drop from [[Chest]]s.
* [[Dungeons]], extremely rare drop from boss chests.

