== Notes ==
* Not all variants of this item may stack.
* Only Bag of Jewels obtained from [[dungeons]] and [[Living World]] chapter [[Arcana Obscura]] (only from first time completion) work in the forge.
** Bags from the [[Karmic Converter]] obtained prior to the November 10, 2026 update can also be used.
** Any from other sources ([[Ley-Energy Matter Converter]], Guild Hall Merchants, etc.) will NOT go in the Forge.
* This item is account bound if purchased via the Karmic Converter or Ley-Energy Matter Converter, or if received from Arcana Obscura story step.

